x,$ we get\n\n$$\n{∮}_{C}P\\,\\text{d}x+Q\\,\\text{d}y={∮}_{C}x\\,\\text{d}y.\n$$\n\n \n\nThe derivative of $r(t)$ is\n\n$$\n{r}^{′}(t)=⟨-2\\sin(t),\\,12\\cos(t)⟩.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can write our line integral as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∮}_{C}x\\,dy & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }2\\cos(t)\\cdot 12\\cos(t)\\,dt \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }24\\cos^{2}(t)\\,dt.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186522934 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "13254f22-ba24-5a26-ac20-b1d01c1d9a8d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "169 \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} \\cos{\\left(t \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186522931} {:answer/id #uuid "15581fe7-9ae8-54d4-80b7-b3c1f35c74f5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "13 \\cos^{2}{\\left(t \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186522932} {:answer/id #uuid "5bcea2ea-e6c2-5f17-8ad4-4bea9e89ca20" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "169 \\cos^{2}{\\left(t \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186522956} {:answer/id #uuid "5da8822a-ff5b-58c7-b837-c9cb2095ad8b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 169 \\cos^{2}{\\left(t \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186522959} {:answer/id #uuid "e2277cd7-b561-587b-9358-14326d33df55" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "338 \\cos^{2}{\\left(t \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523003}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5bcea2ea-e6c2-5f17-8ad4-4bea9e89ca20" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "169 \\cos^{2}{\\left(t \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186522956} :answer-field/id #uuid "a259361d-22ee-50c9-9106-e04bd3a3edff" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186522983}] :questio