e derivative of $r(t)$ is\n\n$$\nr'(t)=⟨18\\cos(t),\\,-18\\sin(t)⟩.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can write our line integral as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\oint_Cy\\,\\mathrm{d}x&=\\int_{0}^{2 \\pi}18\\cos(t)\\cdot 18\\cos(t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t\\\\&=\\int_{0}^{2 \\pi}324\\cos^{2}(t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186522954 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6c9441f0-8025-50de-92dd-b68a5473e6df" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "48 \\cos{\\left(t \\right)} \\cos{\\left(2 t \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186522964} {:answer/id #uuid "72138b32-51b5-521a-825b-63805481f838" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4 \\cos{\\left(t \\right)} \\cos{\\left(2 t \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186522965} {:answer/id #uuid "80d97e84-96e2-52b3-b2fa-9f92fd3dc027" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 24 \\cos{\\left(t \\right)} \\cos{\\left(2 t \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186522971} {:answer/id #uuid "f52e2b91-2584-5d73-a7bd-a35995deadde" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12 \\sin{\\left(2 t \\right)} \\cos{\\left(t \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523009} {:answer/id #uuid "f89a05e1-4245-5973-8c82-77913d1c69af" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "24 \\cos{\\left(t \\right)} \\cos{\\left(2 t \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523012}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f89a05e1-4245-5973-8c82-77913d1c69af" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "24 \\cos{\\left(t \\right)} \\cos{\\left(2 t \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523012} :answer-field/id #uuid "93c6e54f-a830-57c6-980f-afa5053f5253" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/i