,y)=x,$ we get\n\n$$\n{∮}_{C}P\\,\\text{d}x+Q\\,\\text{d}y={∮}_{C}x\\,\\text{d}y.\n$$\n\n \n\nThe derivative of $r(t)$ is\n\n$$\n{r}^{′}(t)=⟨-10\\sin(t),\\,4\\cos(t)⟩.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can write our line integral as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∮}_{C}x\\,dy & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }10\\cos(t)\\cdot 4\\cos(t)\\,dt \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }40\\cos^{2}(t)\\,dt.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186522984 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2f4a1110-34fc-5148-a06f-96646119ba61" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "24 \\sin^{2}{\\left(t \\right)} - 72 \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} \\sin{\\left(2 t \\right)} + 48 \\sin^{2}{\\left(2 t \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186522942} {:answer/id #uuid "3f3bdd1f-89e4-5d99-bc21-dfa17ad588d1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3 \\sin^{2}{\\left(t \\right)} - 9 \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} \\sin{\\left(2 t \\right)} + 6 \\sin^{2}{\\left(2 t \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186522946} {:answer/id #uuid "5169bc62-4492-5bdf-b8a8-6d2f84ea9544" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 12 \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} \\cos{\\left(t \\right)} + 12 \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} \\cos{\\left(2 t \\right)} + 12 \\sin{\\left(2 t \\right)} \\cos{\\left(t \\right)} - 12 \\sin{\\left(2 t \\right)} \\cos{\\left(2 t \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186522953} {:answer/id #uuid "9c99c8aa-da9b-5733-98eb-0e6ec4d6b9a1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12 \\sin^{2}{\\left(t \\right)} - 36 \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} \\sin{\\left(2 t \\right)} + 24 \\sin^{2}{\\left(2 t \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186522982} {:answer/id #uuid "c12808f6-237f-5b1f-86c7-3023f50a79af" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 12 \\sin^{2}{\\left(t \\right)} + 36 \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} \\sin{\